WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.908
Sunday morning, and the songs are in one app.

2
00:00:05.008 --> 00:00:07.727
The slides are in another.

3
00:00:07.827 --> 00:00:10.382
The stream is in a third.

4
00:00:10.482 --> 00:00:14.075
Lampstand puts all of it on one laptop.

5
00:00:14.175 --> 00:00:16.619
It is free and open source.

6
00:00:16.719 --> 00:00:20.366
It runs offline, and a volunteer can learn it in ten minutes.
